{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "description": "entity.attack({ uuid?, name?, radius?, count?, interval_ms?, wait_cooldown? })。v1.6 左键实体。\n\n与 ``entity.use`` 同一套目标解析；区别是走 ``gameMode.attack``。\n``wait_cooldown``（缺省 true）会等到攻击冷却好了再打——冷却没满时伤害按比例\n衰减，还会吃攻击速率惩罚。",
